      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;heading-element&#34; id=&#34;-hello-im-yao-chaohao-crisyao&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;👋 Hello, I&amp;rsquo;m Yao Chaohao (CRISYAO)&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#-hello-im-yao-chaohao-crisyao&#34; class=&#34;heading-mark&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;svg class=&#34;octicon octicon-link&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 16 16&#34; version=&#34;1.1&#34; width=&#34;16&#34; height=&#34;16&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z&#34;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;I currently lead the TGT (Tech Genius Team) program at JD.com, a premier global campus recruitment initiative dedicated to scouting the next generation of technical leaders. My mission is to identify the world&amp;rsquo;s most promising PhDs and researchers, bridging the transition from academic excellence to large-scale industrial impact within JD’s massive retail ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 class=&#34;heading-element&#34; id=&#34;-career-path&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;💼 Career Path&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#-career-path&#34; class=&#34;heading-mark&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;svg class=&#34;octicon octicon-link&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 16 16&#34; version=&#34;1.1&#34; width=&#34;16&#34; height=&#34;16&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 